WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.921
"This is bad," Detective Smith said.

2
00:00:04.922 --> 00:00:07.861
"People all over the city are trapped in their houses.

3
00:00:07.862 --> 00:00:11.379
We'll go to Brenda and Dan Dooley's house first. They live at . . ."

4
00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:15.739
"Ten Puddle Lane!" Roxy took off.

5
00:00:15.739 --> 00:00:19.550
Detective Smith groaned. "Rocket Girl never—"

6
00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:23.812
A police officer ran in. "Our police cars were stolen!"

7
00:00:23.812 --> 00:00:32.742
The detective groaned again.

8
00:00:32.743 --> 00:00:43.937
*** No one answered the Dooleys' door, so Roxy entered the house.

9
00:00:43.937 --> 00:00:46.583
"Hello?" Click! The floor

10
00:00:46.584 --> 00:00:48.065
moved. Roxy jumped

11
00:00:48.066 --> 00:00:51.213
up. Ba-doom! The floor

12
00:00:51.213 --> 00:00:54.067
opened. Roxy flew

13
00:00:54.068 --> 00:00:58.263
down. "Rocket Girl, thank goodness!" Mr. Dooley

14
00:00:58.263 --> 00:01:01.447
said. "Our phones can't get a signal down

15
00:01:01.448 --> 00:01:04.373
here." Roxy carried the couple out of the dark

16
00:01:04.374 --> 00:01:08.702
room. Mrs. Dooley gasped as they flew through the

17
00:01:08.703 --> 00:01:11.410
house. "Where's our

18
00:01:11.410 --> 00:01:15.572
furniture?" "Our TV is gone!" Mr. Dooley

19
00:01:15.573 --> 00:01:17.707
cried. Roxy brought them to the front

20
00:01:17.708 --> 00:01:20.652
yard. "How long were you trapped down

21
00:01:20.653 --> 00:01:23.713
there?" "Since yesterday," Mr. Dooley

22
00:01:23.714 --> 00:01:26.627
said. "Our builder finished working on the

23
00:01:26.628 --> 00:01:29.113
house. He told us to take a

24
00:01:29.114 --> 00:01:31.242
look. Everything looked

25
00:01:31.242 --> 00:01:37.869
awful. Then the floor opened up, and we slid down into that

26
00:01:37.869 --> 00:01:40.626
room." "Who was the builder?" Roxy

27
00:01:40.626 --> 00:01:44.731
asked. "His name is Jack Hammer," Mrs. Dooley

28
00:01:44.732 --> 00:01:46.433
said. Mr. Dooley

29
00:01:46.434 --> 00:01:48.205
frowned. "We won't hire him

30
00:01:48.206 --> 00:01:51.862
again. I'm going to give him a bad online review too!"

31
00:01:51.863 --> 00:01:55.644
"Jack Hammer trapped other people," Roxy said.

32
00:01:55.644 --> 00:01:58.353
"I have to stop him!"

33
00:01:58.354 --> 00:02:01.653
Mr. Dooley looked up Jack Hammer on his phone.

34
00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:04.208
He gave the builder's address to Roxy.

35
00:02:04.209 --> 00:02:06.358
Roxy arrived at the office.

36
00:02:06.359 --> 00:02:10.861
It was in an old factory.

37
00:02:10.862 --> 00:02:13.236
A big man sat behind a desk.

38
00:02:13.236 --> 00:02:16.492
He wore overalls and a hard hat.

39
00:02:16.492 --> 00:02:19.646
"Jack Hammer!" Roxy shouted.

40
00:02:19.646 --> 00:02:23.441
The man stood up. "Hello, Rocket Girl."

41
00:02:23.441 --> 00:02:28.302
Roxy frowned. "Why are you trapping people in their houses?"

42
00:02:28.303 --> 00:02:33.250
Jack snorted. "Why do you think? I want to steal stuff.

43
00:02:33.251 --> 00:02:35.511
And it's not just houses.

44
00:02:35.512 --> 00:02:39.669
Recently, I worked on police headquarters and a school."

45
00:02:39.669 --> 00:02:44.159
Roxy narrowed her eyes. "What school?"

46
00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:49.294
"Metro City Elementary." Jack Hammer looked at his watch.

47
00:02:49.295 --> 00:02:53.526
"In fact, I should probably head over there now."

48
00:02:53.534 --> 00:02:56.584
"Grr!" Roxy rushed toward the villain.

49
00:02:56.585 --> 00:02:58.529
He stepped quickly through a door.

50
00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:02.781
Roxy burst through and found herself in a large, empty room.

51
00:03:02.781 --> 00:03:09.708
"Huh?" The room spun, and Roxy was thrown against a wall. "Oof!"

52
00:03:09.709 --> 00:03:18.465
When the room stopped spinning, Roxy ran through another door.

53
00:03:18.466 --> 00:03:20.284
Mirrors surrounded her.

54
00:03:20.285 --> 00:03:22.911
Her reflection was everywhere.

55
00:03:22.912 --> 00:03:27.444
Roxy gulped. "I'm stuck in an evil fun house!"

56
00:03:27.445 --> 00:03:32.033
She heard Jack Hammer laugh.

57
00:03:32.033 --> 00:03:36.930
"You'll never get out, Rocket Girl!"

